macro rules: command 3 decl, Lean.Elab.macroAttribute in stateOnly false, entries false, scoped ops true, noskip (some false)
  y: full run OfNat.ofNat.{0} Nat 2 (instOfNatNat 2), after replay OfNat.ofNat.{0} Nat 2 (instOfNatNat 2)
instances: command 3 decl, Lean.Meta.instanceExtension in stateOnly false, entries false, scoped ops true, noskip (some false)
  y: full run C.v i2, after replay C.v i2
simp lemmas: command 4 decl, Lean.Meta.simpExtension in stateOnly false, entries false, scoped ops true, noskip (some false)
  replay accepted
notations: command 2 decl, Lean.Parser.parserExtension in stateOnly false, entries false, scoped ops true, noskip (some false)
  replay accepted
